    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Introduction:</strong><br><i>Dark Genesis</i> is a realistic and immersive first-person single-player shooting game created using Unreal Engine 5. Developed by a solo developer, this title offers players a unique sense of fear and tension through bodycam camera perspective and realistic graphics. With a short playtime of 30\u201360 minutes, it delivers an intense and memorable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Background:</strong><br>The protagonist, while on patrol, receives an urgent call from a remote rural village and heads to the scene. However, the villagers exhibit strange behavior, and as the investigation progresses, the protagonist uncovers the truth about dark experiments conducted at the newly established &quot;Necrogen Hospital.&quot; A fierce battle for survival unfolds as secrets are revealed.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431380/extras/38a4bf2f2ab620a5f7bf4d7f2037800f.avif?t=1739328577\" data-has-big width=800 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Bodycam Perspective:</strong> A unique perspective immersing players in the protagonist's view, offering a vivid sense of realism.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431380/extras/30836be8cf5b4b3014261f73fa1a37c9.poster.avif?t=1739328577\" width=622 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431380/extras/30836be8cf5b4b3014261f73fa1a37c9.webm?t=1739328577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431380/extras/30836be8cf5b4b3014261f73fa1a37c9.mp4?t=1739328577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unreal Engine 5 Graphics:</strong> Cutting-edge technology delivers high-quality graphics for an enhanced visual experience.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431380/extras/417a17c03d301e4ed3e24f4cd0448bc4.avif?t=1739328577\" data-has-big width=800 height=432 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Horror Elements:</strong> Narrow, dark environments create a sense of fear and urgency, with survival and combat at the forefront.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431380/extras/656f53bd0ec0555de1b41edbdcde3416.poster.avif?t=1739328577\" width=582 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431380/extras/656f53bd0ec0555de1b41edbdcde3416.webm?t=1739328577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431380/extras/656f53bd0ec0555de1b41edbdcde3416.mp4?t=1739328577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short but Powerful Gameplay:</strong> A 30- to 60-minute compact story and gameplay experience that keeps players engaged.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer's Note:</strong><br><i>Dark Genesis</i> is the first project by a developer who self-taught Unreal Engine. While there may be some shortcomings, the game represents a passionate effort and dedication to creation. We hope you enjoy this unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adult Content Warning:</strong><br>This game may not be suitable for all ages and includes the following adult content:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frequent violence and graphic depictions of blood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense visual elements that may induce fear.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please be aware of these elements before playing.</p>",
